            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.28</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Bumps on the desktop you’re using

FIXED
Bumps now appear on the active display, including full-screen apps, and stay visible when you switch desktops.
Opening Firstlight no longer hides arriving bumps or clears bumps waiting to appear.
]]></description>
