            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.27</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[Clear confirmation after account deletion

FIXED
After deleting your account, Firstlight confirms that your account and activity have been deleted and offers to quit. It no longer opens onboarding after deletion.

Reopening the sign-in window now keeps its background opaque and its controls readable.
]]></description>
